*sigcatch* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''sigcatch(signums)''

Registers a list of operating system ''signums'' for interception and suspends default signal handling behaviour.

*Parameters:*
- ''signums'': List of signal numbers

*Returns:*
- ''ok''

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if signums is not a list
- Runtime error if signums contains a non-number

*Important:*
Signal registration is process wide, not per actor runtime.

Calling ''sigcatch(signums)'' from any actor catches ''signums'' for the whole program.
